IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77843,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"263962cd27fc5b3b91a4ebf78ef3100e","RawContent":"@[member=\"Lia33\"] That sounds amazing! I will def check it out. Beach would be nice as I feel we won&#039;t get a lot of beach time during our wedding week, but I really want to make sure we get rainforest\/wildlife since that is completely new to us.\n\n\nBTW we are holding off on booking our flight to SJO until September. It&#039;s a brand new route for Volaris that they aren&#039;t flying until September. When I go to book the flight for April, it says \"subject to govt approval\". Although it will let me book it, it makes me a little nervous. So we&#039;re going to wait until they at least start flying that route. [emoji15]\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1901546,"PostDate":1438224917,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279182\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279182-lia33\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Lia33<\/span><\/a> That sounds amazing! I will def check it out. Beach would be nice as I feel we won't get a lot of beach time during our wedding week, but I really want to make sure we get rainforest\/wildlife since that is completely new to us.<br><br>\nBTW we are holding off on booking our flight to SJO until September. It's a brand new route for Volaris that they aren't flying until September. When I go to book the flight for April, it says \"subject to govt approval\". Although it will let me book it, it makes me a little nervous. So we're going to wait until they at least start flying that route. [emoji15]<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>- Erin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79068-vancouverpetunia-now-sapphire-april-7-2016\/?p=1893268<\/a>","Email":"ekjzwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.85.127.174","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1417449445,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281283.jpg?_r=1428779369","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vancouverpetunia","Id":281283,"Name":"vancouverpetunia","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77843","Title":"Traveling To Another Country From Mexico For The Honeymoon?","LastPostDate":1438224917},"Pages":{"TotalItems":11,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
