n":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b49503e3647de5e7c7e1d85e6b3716e3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;As badly as I wanted to fly somewhere different for the honeymoon, we will just go ahead and book at another resort for a few days. Too many expenses! We will take a trip later on. The important thing is us just getting some alone relaxed time with just the two of us :-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880147,"PostDate":1418324608,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>As badly as I wanted to fly somewhere different for the honeymoon, we will just go ahead and book at another resort for a few days. Too many expenses! We will take a trip later on. The important thing is us just getting some alone relaxed time with just the two of us :-)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"limaldo96@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.196.202.228","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406476517,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279182.jpg?_r=1406769983","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":168,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lia33","Id":279182,"Name":"Lia33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77645,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a6d95c470ca1cacaabe1d002fe311e73","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We really wanted to go to another resort too, but it seemed more difficult than it would be worth it. &amp;nbsp;So we just decided to stay longer at the resort and we are planning a 1 year anniversary trip for 2016 as our \"honeymoon\".&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880152,"PostDate":1418327324,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We really wanted to go to another resort too, but it seemed more difficult than it would be worth it. \u00a0So we just decided to stay longer at the resort and we are planning a 1 year anniversary trip for 2016 as our \"honeymoon\".<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sabrabenes@gmail.com","IpAddress":"64.147.11.58","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403208876,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278603.jpg?_r=1405559586","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sabes44","Id":278603,"Name":"Sabes44","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.54.197.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77645,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e776af68137147d14f3e893c6c47cc14","RawContent":"I love the idea of switching resorts! While I love my family, I want some quality alone time with my new husband! I&#039;m still looking at resorts, so the possibility of changing resorts is going to factor in my decision","Attachments":[],"Id":1885944,"PostDate":1423606353,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I love the idea of switching resorts! While I love my family, I want some quality alone time with my new husband! I'm still looking at resorts, so the possibility of changing resorts is going to factor in my decision\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmf0408@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.54.64.217","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423576366,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Cablelove11","Id":282063,"Name":"Cablelove11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.165.141.121","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77645,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5520680dcd5e9e5d288213445bd78b95","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Since I last posted on this thread we DID decide to do a separate honeymoon later on. My fianc\u00e9 really wants to go to Peru and Machu Picchu but it is just impossible to get there from Jamaica. It just seemed silly to spend money on something else if that is what he REALLY wants to do. I ultimately deferred to him, so we&#039;ll do it in the fall.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Honestly, I think I&#039;ll be so exhausted after the wedding anyway. And it&#039;ll be nice to have something to look forward to when we get back home.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885998,"PostDate":1423626799,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Since I last posted on this thread we DID decide to do a separate honeymoon later on. My fianc\u00e9 really wants to go to Peru and Machu Picchu but it is just impossible to get there from Jamaica. It just seemed silly to spend money on something else if that is what he REALLY wants to do. I ultimately deferred to him, so we'll do it in the fall.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Honestly, I think I'll be so exhausted after the wedding anyway. And it'll be nice to have something to look forward to when we get back home.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403116087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.51.153.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77645,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"40a38f3e8934fe4f9a383f4b138c65f7","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Lia33\" post=\"1862776\" timestamp=\"1406562529\"]\nI&#039;m wondering if people are doing anything to differentiate their honeymoon time from wedding\/celebration time...\n\nMy Fianc\u00e9 would like to just spend a week at the resort which is fine, but if guests make a vacation out of their wedding attendance, I don&#039;t know that I want to be hanging out all week with them! I want alone time with my new hubby!\n\nSome ideas that I had was maybe leaving to another resort a couple of days after the wedding to ensure some newlywed alone time or flying out elsewhere (which I don&#039;t think he wants to do).\n\nAm I being a little too picky? Thoughts?\nFound a thread already on this! This site covers everything :)[\/quote]I think my FI and I will eventually do Europe for our honeymoon. We won&#039;t be going right away because we plan on buying a house after the wedding, but hopefully in a year or so following the wedding.","Attachments":[],"Id":1886258,"PostDate":1423797006,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Lia33, on 28 July 2014 - 07:48 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I'm wondering if people are doing anything to differentiate their honeymoon time from wedding\/celebration time...<br><br>\nMy Fianc\u00e9 would like to just spend a week at the resort which is fine, but if guests make a vacation out of their wedding attendance, I don't know that I want to be hanging out all week with them! I want alone time with my new hubby!<br><br>\nSome ideas that I had was maybe leaving to another resort a couple of days after the wedding to ensure some newlywed alone time or flying out elsewhere (which I don't think he wants to do).<br><br>\nAm I being a little too picky? Thoughts?<br>\nFound a thread already on this! This site covers everything <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I think my FI and I will eventually do Europe for our honeymoon. We won't be going right away because we plan on buying a house after the wedding, but hopefully in a year or so following the wedding.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.196.202.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77645,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6dbd2d768c2228d1e76c11b7e6f8beb8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Since I last posted, we actually decided to fly back to NY after our wedding week, and leave a few days later to go to Costa Rica for our honeymoon! I may little exhausted but it will be a relaxing trip so I&#039;m super excited since I&#039;ve always wanted to go here &amp;nbsp;:-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886423,"PostDate":1424032649,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Since I last posted, we actually decided to fly back to NY after our wedding week, and leave a few days later to go to Costa Rica for our honeymoon! I may little exhausted but it will be a relaxing trip so I'm super excited since I've always wanted to go here \u00a0:-)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"limaldo96@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.196.202.228","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406476517,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279182.jpg?_r=1406769983","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":168,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lia33","Id":279182,"Name":"Lia33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"116.100.135.217","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77645,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2e20f4f97f2ca13ded2711ee59c4358a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Maybe you can announce it in a fun way on your weekend itinerary.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893523,"PostDate":1429333693,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Maybe you can announce it in a fun way on your weekend itinerary.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/navavina.com.vn\/tin-tuc\/gia-ke-sat-van-phong-cao-cap-cua-navavina.html'>gi\u00e1 k\u1ec7 s\u1eaft<\/a> v\u0103n ph\u00f2ng","Email":"tuan_anh8127@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"116.100.135.217","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1429333413,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282778.jpg?_r=1429804303","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"maskters","Id":282778,"Name":"maskters","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"77645","Title":"Separate Honeymoon Plans?","LastPostDate":1429333693},"Pages":{"TotalItems":27,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
