{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":20,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":2078,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1465683,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":237060,"Name":"jamieirene","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237060.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1307561752,"LastPoster":{"Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":32,"Preview":{"Id":1875175,"PostDate":1412989735,"PostContent":"^^ We locked in our rates but every week I notice there is a price drop on Tuesday and Wednesday...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409091107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61614,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f7dc0b8f9f375886d0ac6ea1d399185e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey All, I am a Travel agent, and I specialize in DW.&amp;nbsp; In fact I only book group travel, the vast majority is for weddings.  &amp;nbsp; Honestly, this year has been the craziest year for DW groups.&amp;nbsp; Out of Alberta (where I live and work) the flights to the major gateways are already sold out for April and May.   I don&#039;t know why any travel agent would suggest waiting until now to book for a wedding, but I&#039;m afraid you might have gotten some bad advice.   In canada we always book our all inclusives as charter packages, with the tour operators that might only offer 1 flight direct\/week.&amp;nbsp; I know out of the US you will go for shorter durations which means you fly scheduled airlines, because of that it might be the reason they said to wait. Since it&#039;s not packages you&#039;re booking, it&#039;s the airline ticket only.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I always recommend booking the group 8-12 months prior to the wedding, and yes you&#039;re right, online the rates may not be in the system.&amp;nbsp; The way it works is the tour operators give us an estimate based on the time of year, and what it cost the year prior.  &amp;nbsp; This is called Pre-registration AKA waitlist.&amp;nbsp; So basically if you got a group quote 12 months prior and put your deposits down, and got your group in place, you are guaranteeing that your group can all travel on the same flight, to the same hotel, at the rate contracted.   If when they do put prices out online they are selling it for less, the tour operator will match your group&#039;s rates with the accurate selling price for whomever within your group have paid their deposits.  &amp;nbsp; If it comes out and the accurate selling price is higher than your group quote, anyone within your group who has paid deposit will get to keep your pre-registered rate, but people booking later have to pay the new pricing.  &amp;nbsp; Then there are some tour operators that do offer the 1 time price downgrade, but only up to 60 days prior to departure.&amp;nbsp; So if the rates are reduced after they are starting to sell online, so say 3 or 4 months prior to the wedding, then you can use your one time price reduction for anyone who paid deposit within your group, and everyone&#039;s rates come down.   They will not do this for every sale and promo that comes out over the next year, and you have to remember that it&#039;s not just a holiday, it&#039;s your wedding.&amp;nbsp; You&#039;re going to have to send rooming lists to the resort about 1 month prior, you need to organize your dinner, and set up your budget, so if all of a sudden within a few weeks of the wedding people start booknig because it&#039;s cheap, then it can kind of screw over your plans.&amp;nbsp; Especially if you&#039;ve been making OOT bags, and didn&#039;t factor in those last minute additions.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; As for the rooms not being available at the hotel, and they are availabel with a tour operator - it&#039;s because tour operators buy a bunch of rooms so the hotel sells out, but the tour operators have the rooms in their allotment to sell in conjunction with the airline tickets.&amp;nbsp; Buying in bulk is why the rates are usually better through a Tour operator than through a hotel directly.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Sorry for the long winded response, but I felt like I should explain how we can get rates prior to them being for sale online!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have been getting requests for wedding groups for April and May 2012 and I haven&#039;t had any luck finding them anything, and honestly the rates now are higher than had they booked in April\/May 2011 for 2012.   So it&#039;s unfortunate, but you have to book early!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; TTFN!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; laurie&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1538164,"PostDate":1319488290,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey All, I am a Travel agent, and I specialize in DW.\u00a0 In fact I only book group travel, the vast majority is for weddings.\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Honestly, this year has been the craziest year for DW groups.\u00a0 Out of Alberta (where I live and work) the flights to the major gateways are already sold out for April and May.\u00a0\u00a0 I don't know why any travel agent would suggest waiting until now to book for a wedding, but I'm afraid you might have gotten some bad advice.\u00a0\u00a0 In canada we always book our all inclusives as charter packages, with the tour operators that might only offer 1 flight direct\/week.\u00a0 I know out of the US you will go for shorter durations which means you fly scheduled airlines, because of that it might be the reason they said to wait. Since it's not packages you're booking, it's the airline ticket only.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I always recommend booking the group 8-12 months prior to the wedding, and yes you're right, online the rates may not be in the system.\u00a0 The way it works is the tour operators give us an estimate based on the time of year, and what it cost the year prior.\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 This is called Pre-registration AKA waitlist.\u00a0 So basically if you got a group quote 12 months prior and put your deposits down, and got your group in place, you are guaranteeing that your group can all travel on the same flight, to the same hotel, at the rate contracted.\u00a0\u00a0 If when they do put prices out online they are selling it for less, the tour operator will match your group's rates with the accurate selling price for whomever within your group have paid their deposits.\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 If it comes out and the accurate selling price is higher than your group quote, anyone within your group who has paid deposit will get to keep your pre-registered rate, but people booking later have to pay the new pricing.\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Then there are some tour operators that do offer the 1 time price downgrade, but only up to 60 days prior to departure.\u00a0 So if the rates are reduced after they are starting to sell online, so say 3 or 4 months prior to the wedding, then you can use your one time price reduction for anyone who paid deposit within your group, and everyone's rates come down.\u00a0\u00a0 They will not do this for every sale and promo that comes out over the next year, and you have to remember that it's not just a holiday, it's your wedding.\u00a0 You're going to have to send rooming lists to the resort about 1 month prior, you need to organize your dinner, and set up your budget, so if all of a sudden within a few weeks of the wedding people start booknig because it's cheap, then it can kind of screw over your plans.\u00a0 Especially if you've been making OOT bags, and didn't factor in those last minute additions.\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> As for the rooms not being available at the hotel, and they are availabel with a tour operator - it's because tour operators buy a bunch of rooms so the hotel sells out, but the tour operators have the rooms in their allotment to sell in conjunction with the airline tickets.\u00a0 Buying in bulk is why the rates are usually better through a Tour operator than through a hotel directly.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Sorry for the long winded response, but I felt like I should explain how we can get rates prior to them being for sale online!!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have been getting requests for wedding groups for April and May 2012 and I haven't had any luck finding them anything, and honestly the rates now are higher than had they booked in April\/May 2011 for 2012.\u00a0\u00a0 So it's unfortunate, but you have to book early!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> TTFN!<\/p> <p> laurie<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lauriannebourgeois@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1313849644,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-244162.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":101,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DwBride2Be","Id":244162,"Name":"DwBride2Be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61614,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ce20c25102a1893142ad969b7b0f45a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Just another tidbit...the best day of the week to book flights is Tuesday. Since a lot of people look for flights over the weekend they tend to be higher. You don&#039;t have to fly out on a tuesday, just look at booking then.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1547292,"PostDate":1321462238,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Just another tidbit...the best day of the week to book flights is Tuesday. Since a lot of people look for flights over the weekend they tend to be higher. You don't have to fly out on a tuesday, just look at booking then.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mrobbins3@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1315580530,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245110.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsF","Id":245110,"Name":"FutureMrsF","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":61614,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d88404c770459ca80b7a7691ef43af8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Those are great deals 8 months advance is much lesser compare to lesser month.&amp;nbsp; Good luck to your wedding.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; _____________________&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.cebubeachresorts.com\/\"&gt;Cebu Beach Resorts&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1550467,"PostDate":1322225486,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Those are great deals 8 months advance is much lesser compare to lesser month.\u00a0 Good luck to your wedding.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> _____________________<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.cebubeachresorts.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cebu Beach Resorts<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"markzdemetrez@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1322223317,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248017.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"markzdemetrez","Id":248017,"Name":"markzdemetrez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61614,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f8f3403a26a997dc1a6913dbcbd04b91","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve been having such a hard time trying to figure out when I should send out invites\/ have people RSVP! We invited about 100 people and really have no idea how many are going to come! I was hoping to be able to have them RSVP by 5-6 months in advance- does anyone think that this is way too early?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1736872,"PostDate":1363908240,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I've been having such a hard time trying to figure out when I should send out invites\/ have people RSVP! We invited about 100 people and really have no idea how many are going to come! I was hoping to be able to have them RSVP by 5-6 months in advance- does anyone think that this is way too early?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jgilbalt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.61.152.152","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1351563698,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261899.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jessica G","Id":261899,"Name":"Jessica G","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.117.76.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61614,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b5856bd26f46e2c08f580e2e3d29eb1","RawContent":"I&#039;m debating about the best time to book as well - thanks for this post","Attachments":[],"Id":1855839,"PostDate":1403047397,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm debating about the best time to book as well - thanks for this post \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"taryn_henderson@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.117.76.99","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402952494,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"tarynh86","Id":278544,"Name":"tarynh86","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.114.27.37","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61614,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"20595f2c85e49bcf79532f8ee5348bf6","RawContent":"[quote name=\"tarynh86\" post=\"1855839\" timestamp=\"1403047397\"]\nI&#039;m debating about the best time to book as well - thanks for this post[\/quote]Keep in mind this information is not the same for Canadians as we work with your operators who offer packages. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1855854,"PostDate":1403049647,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>tarynh86, on 17 June 2014 - 03:23 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I'm debating about the best time to book as well - thanks for this post<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nKeep in mind this information is not the same for Canadians as we work with your operators who offer packages. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kmkwedding2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.72.195.234","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1390256608,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kmk2016","Id":276231,"Name":"kmk2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.226.199.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61614,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"12c4c710f1204dc75f4f604dbaa9eeee","RawContent":"WOW! Thanks for all the information.","Attachments":[],"Id":1857851,"PostDate":1404272479,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                WOW! Thanks for all the information.   \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spadeincwedding@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.226.206.246","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396402180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"NixSpade","Id":277449,"Name":"NixSpade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.47.49.223","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61614,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"125d8d69f20fc872469ac2fd43ea04b2","RawContent":"Great info. Puts pricing into perspective","Attachments":[],"Id":1868928,"PostDate":1409016887,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great info. Puts pricing into perspective\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jolie.vidal@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.143.69.5","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1408558257,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"BrideToBeJolie","Id":279500,"Name":"BrideToBeJolie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.110.14.60","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61614,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"edc5a4ecbdb615403f6854dea14486a0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"FutureMrsF\" post=\"1547292\" timestamp=\"1321462238\"]\nJust another tidbit...the best day of the week to book flights is Tuesday. Since a lot of people look for flights over the weekend they tend to be higher. You don&#039;t have to fly out on a tuesday, just look at booking then.[\/quote]\nAgreed, we saved a lot of money but doing this!","Attachments":[],"Id":1875171,"PostDate":1412988977,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>FutureMrsF, on 16 November 2011 - 08:50 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Just another tidbit...the best day of the week to book flights is Tuesday. Since a lot of people look for flights over the weekend they tend to be higher. You don't have to fly out on a tuesday, just look at booking then.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Agreed, we saved a lot of money but doing this!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jessicarr859@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.110.14.60","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412988717,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jessicarr","Id":280454,"Name":"jessicarr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.227.239.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":61614,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b3fd0fa32fd8855df63cea77eaede069","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;^^ We locked in our rates but every week I notice there is a price drop on Tuesday and Wednesday for other flights we were looking into for our guest. We are monitoring the rates with Hipmunk.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875175,"PostDate":1412989735,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>^^ We locked in our rates but every week I notice there is a price drop on Tuesday and Wednesday for other flights we were looking into for our guest. We are monitoring the rates with Hipmunk.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"keishaandjimmy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"192.31.106.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1409091107,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"puravida2015","Id":279580,"Name":"puravida2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"61614","Title":"Useful Travel Pricing Information!!  If you want to save check it out!","LastPostDate":1412989735},"Pages":{"TotalItems":20,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
