{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":32174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f52347377267d0e1255d22ec1cf047ae","RawContent":"We&#039;ve been to our resort twice already and the locals have been fantastic! We have never had a problem at all and we&#039;ve gone into town several times and travelled to Cozumel via ferry and rented a car.","Attachments":[],"Id":1592801,"PostDate":1331337800,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We've been to our resort twice already and the locals have been fantastic! We have never had a problem at all and we've gone into town several times and travelled to Cozumel via ferry and rented a car.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"realcdngirl@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1330457269,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252057.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":147,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Realcdngirl","Id":252057,"Name":"Realcdngirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":32174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f13a18fef04c958449e6c08764e95f44","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Does anyone have positive feedback from their trip to Puerto Vallarta? &amp;nbsp;Did you feel you or your guests weren&#039;t able to fully enjoy themselves? Or once you got there did you &#039;forget&#039; about the travel warnings? &amp;nbsp;Looking for some feedback from the last few months. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1606165,"PostDate":1334104312,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Does anyone have positive feedback from their trip to Puerto Vallarta? \u00a0Did you feel you or your guests weren't able to fully enjoy themselves? Or once you got there did you 'forget' about the travel warnings? \u00a0Looking for some feedback from the last few months. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"henrich2@uwm.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1314840436,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-244619.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":170,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Krs398","Id":244619,"Name":"Krs398","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":32174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b598577d4f1e5a3cc64f4a2f911a8c7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I found this great blog regarding travel in Mexico... it really covers the safety questions! Happy Travels everyone! TA Wendy&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;\"&gt; &lt;tbody&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td style=\"width:60px !important;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"yiv886365920avatar yiv886365920avatar-50\" height=\"50\" src=\"http:\/\/0.gravatar.com\/avatar\/94327c3ca8d677fac02a15599e8a3e5b?s=50&amp;amp;d=identicon&amp;amp;r=G\" width=\"50\" \/&gt;&lt;\/td&gt; &lt;td&gt; &lt;h2 class=\"yiv886365920post-title\" style=\"margin:0;font-size:1.6em;color:#555;margin:0;font-size:1.6em;color:#555;font-size:20px;\"&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/2012\/07\/23\/mexico-maligned\/\"&gt;&lt;span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_2\"&gt;Mexico&amp;nbsp;Maligned&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/h2&gt; &lt;span style=\"color:#888;\"&gt;by &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/author\/travelbyterry\/\"&gt;Terry Denton&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/tbody&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;div class=\"yiv886365920post-content\" style=\"margin-top:1em;max-width:560px;\"&gt; &lt;p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4em;color:#444444;margin:0 0 1em 0;\"&gt; THE MEDIA&#039;S MYOPIA If you look up myopia in thefreedictionary.com you will find it defined as&amp;nbsp;\" . . .a visual defect in which distant objects appear blurred because their images are focused in front of the retina rather than on \u00e2\u20ac\u00a6 &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/2012\/07\/23\/mexico-maligned\/\"&gt;Continue reading &lt;span class=\"yiv886365920meta-nav\"&gt;\u00e2\u2020\u2019&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4em;color:#444444;margin:0 0 1em 0;\"&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/2012\/07\/23\/mexico-maligned\/\"&gt;Read more of this post&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"yiv886365920meta\" style=\"color:#999;font-size:0.9em;margin-top:4px;color:#999;font-size:0.9em;margin-top:4px;line-height:160%;padding:15px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #eee;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;overflow:hidden;\"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/author\/travelbyterry\/\"&gt;Terry Denton&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt; | July 23, 2012 at 9:00 am | Tags: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/tag\/how-safe-is-mexico\/\"&gt;&lt;span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_3\"&gt;How safe is Mexico?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;, &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/tag\/is-mexico-safe\/\"&gt;Is Mexico safe?&lt;\/a&gt;, &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/tag\/mexico\/\"&gt;&lt;span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_4\"&gt;Mexico&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;, &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/tag\/mexico-safety\/\"&gt;&lt;span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_5\"&gt;Mexico safety&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;, &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/tag\/mexico-travel\/\"&gt;&lt;span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_6\"&gt;Mexico travel&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;, &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/tag\/mexico-travel-safety\/\"&gt;&lt;span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_7\"&gt;Mexico travel safety&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;, &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/tag\/travel-in-mexico\/\"&gt;&lt;span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_8\"&gt;Travel in Mexico&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;, &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/tag\/travel-to-mexico\/\"&gt;&lt;span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_9\"&gt;Travel to Mexico&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt; | Categories: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/category\/divine-destinations\/\"&gt;&lt;span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_10\"&gt;Divine Destinations&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt; | URL: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/wp.me\/p2vQmR-7u\"&gt;&lt;span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_11\"&gt;http:\/\/wp.me\/p2vQmR-7u&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div class=\"yiv886365920meta\" style=\"color:#999;font-size:0.9em;margin-top:4px;color:#999;font-size:0.9em;margin-top:4px;line-height:160%;padding:15px 0 15px;border-top:1px solid #eee;border-bottom:1px solid #eee;overflow:hidden;\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1657542,"PostDate":1346177605,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I found this great blog regarding travel in Mexico... it really covers the safety questions! Happy Travels everyone! TA Wendy<\/p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width:60px !important;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" border=\"0\" class=\"yiv886365920avatar yiv886365920avatar-50\" height=\"50\" src=\"http:\/\/0.gravatar.com\/avatar\/94327c3ca8d677fac02a15599e8a3e5b?s=50&d=identicon&r=G\" width=\"50\" \/><\/span><\/td> <td> <h2 class=\"yiv886365920post-title\" style=\"margin:0;font-size:1.6em;color:#555;margin:0;font-size:1.6em;color:#555;font-size:20px;\"> <a href='http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/2012\/07\/23\/mexico-maligned\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_2\">Mexico\u00a0Maligned<\/span><\/a><\/h2> <span  style=\"color:#888\">by <a href='http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/author\/travelbyterry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Terry Denton<\/a><\/span><\/td> <\/tr> <\/tbody> <\/table> <divclass=\"yiv886365920post-content\" > <p  style=\"font-size:14px;color:#444444;margin:0 0 1em 0\"> THE MEDIA'S MYOPIA If you look up myopia in thefreedictionary.com you will find it defined as\u00a0\" . . .a visual defect in which distant objects appear blurred because their images are focused in front of the retina rather than on \u00e2\u20ac\u00a6 <a href='http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/2012\/07\/23\/mexico-maligned\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Continue reading <span class=\"yiv886365920meta-nav\">\u00e2\u2020\u2019<\/span><\/a><\/p> <p  style=\"font-size:14px;color:#444444;margin:0 0 1em 0\"> <a href='http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/2012\/07\/23\/mexico-maligned\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Read more of this post<\/a><\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"yiv886365920meta\"  style=\"color:#999;font-size:0.9em;color:#999;font-size:0.9em\"> <strong><a href='http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/author\/travelbyterry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Terry Denton<\/a><\/strong> | July 23, 2012 at 9:00 am | Tags: <a href='http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/tag\/how-safe-is-mexico\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_3\">How safe is Mexico?<\/span><\/a>, <a href='http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/tag\/is-mexico-safe\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Is Mexico safe?<\/a>, <a href='http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/tag\/mexico\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_4\">Mexico<\/span><\/a>, <a href='http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/tag\/mexico-safety\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_5\">Mexico safety<\/span><\/a>, <a href='http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/tag\/mexico-travel\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_6\">Mexico travel<\/span><\/a>, <a href='http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/tag\/mexico-travel-safety\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_7\">Mexico travel safety<\/span><\/a>, <a href='http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/tag\/travel-in-mexico\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_8\">Travel in Mexico<\/span><\/a>, <a href='http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/tag\/travel-to-mexico\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_9\">Travel to Mexico<\/span><\/a> | Categories: <a href='http:\/\/travelbyterry.wordpress.com\/category\/divine-destinations\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_10\">Divine Destinations<\/span><\/a> | URL: <a href='http:\/\/wp.me\/p2vQmR-7u' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1346177417_11\">http:\/\/wp.me\/p2vQmR-7u<\/span><\/a><\/div> <div class=\"yiv886365920meta\"  style=\"color:#999;font-size:0.9em;color:#999;font-size:0.9em\"> \u00a0<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wendyhicks1@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1238034240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216154.jpg?_r=1419958783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Wendy","Id":216154,"Name":"TA Wendy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":32174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ca17fcd6780ccd0b3e89c661cfda5da","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; When we announced our wedding will be in the Mayan Riveria, some of our friends raised safety concerns. I have a feeling that some of our friends may not come due to the negative assumptions of Mexico.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Have any of you experienced the same reactions from your family and friends when you told them your wedding will be held in Mexico?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1658034,"PostDate":1346266144,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> When we announced our wedding will be in the Mayan Riveria, some of our friends raised safety concerns. I have a feeling that some of our friends may not come due to the negative assumptions of Mexico.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Have any of you experienced the same reactions from your family and friends when you told them your wedding will be held in Mexico?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jessicaandcurtis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1345555503,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259435.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"somethingblue77","Id":259435,"Name":"somethingblue77","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":32174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"03d3751ffc521703d9558c616c5468fb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; It&#039;s unfortunate how many people are misinformed when it come to safety in Mexico, especially the tourist areas were most of us have our weddings.&amp;nbsp; I think some people just look fopr an excuse not to go and the violence in Mexico is an easy cop out.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Fortunately I didn&#039;t have this problem with any of my guests.&amp;nbsp; My Fi and I have been to Mexico twice in the past 4 years and our friends and family trust our judgment and know that we wouldn&#039;t put them in harms way. Those who may have been skeptics did some research and have relieved their own concerns.&amp;nbsp; I think the best thing that you can do is try to educate your guests and direct them to current safety advisories for the country.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Best of Luck.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1658049,"PostDate":1346267280,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> It's unfortunate how many people are misinformed when it come to safety in Mexico, especially the tourist areas were most of us have our weddings.\u00a0 I think some people just look fopr an excuse not to go and the violence in Mexico is an easy cop out.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Fortunately I didn't have this problem with any of my guests.\u00a0 My Fi and I have been to Mexico twice in the past 4 years and our friends and family trust our judgment and know that we wouldn't put them in harms way. Those who may have been skeptics did some research and have relieved their own concerns.\u00a0 I think the best thing that you can do is try to educate your guests and direct them to current safety advisories for the country.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Best of Luck.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tapurnell@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1326174151,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249670.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ChocoTaco7568","Id":249670,"Name":"ChocoTaco7568","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":32174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c536dd6d8e82c0d25c16c57584f6727f","RawContent":"Thank you for this thread. My family is driving me crazy over the safety in Mexico. We are from New Orleans. It was once named the murder capital of the world. I have had a couple of people back out due to fear. Oh we&#039;ll ! Once less OOT Bag to bring.","Attachments":[],"Id":1704008,"PostDate":1357887040,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you for this thread. My family is driving me crazy over the safety in Mexico. We are from New Orleans. It was once named the murder capital of the world. I have had a couple of people back out due to fear. Oh we'll ! Once less OOT Bag to bring.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sparkles3845@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1336846227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255297.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mikeiram","Id":255297,"Name":"mikeiram","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":32174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b55c04aa9036afbda4337b58f7fd713b","RawContent":"Thank you for this thread. My family is driving me crazy over the safety in Mexico. We are from New Orleans. It was once named the murder capital of the world. I have had a couple of people back out due to fear. Oh we&#039;ll ! Once less OOT Bag to bring.","Attachments":[],"Id":1704009,"PostDate":1357887046,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you for this thread. My family is driving me crazy over the safety in Mexico. We are from New Orleans. It was once named the murder capital of the world. I have had a couple of people back out due to fear. Oh we'll ! Once less OOT Bag to bring.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sparkles3845@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1336846227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255297.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mikeiram","Id":255297,"Name":"mikeiram","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":32174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"61d27b4d35c42e578f3990be403ff17e","RawContent":"Thank you for this thread. My family is driving me crazy over the safety in Mexico. We are from New Orleans. It was once named the murder capital of the world. I have had a couple of people back out due to fear. Oh we&#039;ll ! Once less OOT Bag to bring.","Attachments":[],"Id":1704010,"PostDate":1357887062,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you for this thread. My family is driving me crazy over the safety in Mexico. We are from New Orleans. It was once named the murder capital of the world. I have had a couple of people back out due to fear. Oh we'll ! Once less OOT Bag to bring.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sparkles3845@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1336846227,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255297.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mikeiram","Id":255297,"Name":"mikeiram","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":32174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7aaf50de9b14548965c3e49a4c9b4e83","RawContent":"Thank you for this thread. My family is driving me crazy over the safety in Mexico. We are from New Orleans. It was once named the murder capital of the world. I have had a couple of people back out due to fear. Oh we&#039;ll ! Once less OOT Bag to bring.","Attachments":[],"Id":1704011,"PostDate":1357887099,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you for this thread. My family is driving me crazy over the safety in Mexico. We are from New Orleans. It was once named the murder capital of the world. I have had a