ired&amp;quot; for some reason you always get the ones that think it is &amp;quot;required&amp;quot; for everyone but them... &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rant.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Rant\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;So true...That is what is driving me CrAzY!!! ...we&#039;ll see if all the &amp;quot;yes&amp;quot; rsvps make to the wedding!","Attachments":[],"Id":33799,"PostDate":1173691337,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>host<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">its funny, even though you can tell a person 100 times \"passport required\" for some reason you always get the ones that think it is \"required\" for everyone but them... <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rant.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Rant\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>So true...That is what is driving me CrAzY!!! ...we'll see if all the \"yes\" rsvps make to the wedding!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>My new man....Donovan<\/span><br><br><span>Wedding photos and avatar by Jonathan Thrasher Photography - <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jthrasherphoto.com\">www.jthrasherphoto.com<\/a><br><span>Our wedding slide show <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.jthrasherphoto.com\/slideshows\/jessalyn\">www.jthrasherphoto.com\/slideshows\/jessalyn<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/2;54;107\/st\/20090205\/n\/Donovan\/dt\/-3\/k\/27c1\/age.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...k\/27c1\/age.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jessalynj@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1143676200,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206728.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":61,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jessalyn","Id":206728,"Name":"Jessalyn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2328,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"388b4ec49bae9acc72a1166d96ecc6dd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#404040;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\"&gt;US STATE DEPARTMENT - SMART TRAVELER ENROLLMENT PROGRAM (STEP):&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"color:#404040;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:times new roman,serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\"&gt;Before traveling outside of the United States please take the time to visit &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/travel.state.gov\"&gt;http:\/\/travel.state.gov&lt;\/a&gt; for up to date passport requirements and to register for the SMART TRAVELER ENROLLMENT PROGRAM (STEP). You will be able to register your travel outside of the US with the US State Department and they will be able to keep you up to date with the latest safety and security announcements. Your enrollment can also help them reach your family and friends in case of emergency. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"color:#404040;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:times new roman,serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\"&gt;Visit &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/travel.state.gov\/travel\/tips\/registration\/registration_4789.html\"&gt;http:\/\/travel.state.gov\/travel\/tips\/registration\/registration_4789.html&lt;\/a&gt; for more information and to register an upcoming trip.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1624371,"PostDate":1337981167,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <strong><span  style=\"color:#404040\"><span  style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">US STATE DEPARTMENT - SMART TRAVELER ENROLLMENT PROGRAM (STEP):<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color:#404040\"><span  style=\"font-family:times new roman,serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Before traveling outside of the United States please take the time to visit <a href='http:\/\/travel.state.gov' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/travel.state.gov<\/a> for up to date passport requirements and to register for the SMART TRAVELER ENROLLMENT PROGRAM (STEP). You will be able to register your travel outside of the US with the US State Department and they will be able to keep you up to date with the latest safety and security announcements. Your enrollment can also help them reach your family and friends in case of emergency. \u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color:#404040\"><span  style=\"font-family:times new roman,serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:14.0pt\">Visit <a href='http:\/\/travel.state.gov\/travel\/tips\/registration\/registration_4789.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/travel.state....ation_4789.html<\/a> for more information and to register an upcoming trip.\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 12px;'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency | <\/span><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner | Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"patty@wrighttravelagency.com","IpAddress":"76.95.92.213","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1278657480,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230028.jpg?_r=1398727965","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Patty","Id":230028,"Name":"TA Patty","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":2328,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"082ac0d141b1a8cc4fe9cdd7f880b793","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Not only do you have to worry about passports, you need to make sure they are valid.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Your passport cannot expiry within 30 - 90 days of your travel dates each country has different rules.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1624894,"PostDate":1338193454,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Not only do you have to worry about passports, you need to make sure they are valid.<\/p> <p> Your passport cannot expiry within 30 - 90 days of your travel dates each country has different rules.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sapnadigicam@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1338122640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255879.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"whatsup","Id":255879,"Name":"whatsup","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"2328","Title":"Please remind your guests of new passport requirements","LastPostDate":1338193454},"Pages":{"TotalItems":6,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
