iasWeddingFlowerBoutique&lt;\/a&gt;\"]http:\/\/www.plumeriasweddingflowerboutique.com\"&gt;PlumeriasWeddingFlowerBoutique&lt;\/a&gt;[\/url])\n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"[url=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t25223%22&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t25223&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;br\"]http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t25223\"&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t25223&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;br[\/url] \/&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"[url=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t24931%22&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t24931&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;br\"]http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t24931\"&gt;http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t24931&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;br[\/url] \/&gt; [\/LIST]\n \n &lt;strong&gt;&lt;font size=\"4\"&gt;Single Stem Vendors&lt;\/font&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1 888 Flower Mall&lt;\/strong&gt; - (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.1888flowermall.com%22&gt;Wholesale\"]http:\/\/www.1888flowermall.com\"&gt;Wholesale[\/url] Artificial Silk Flowers, Wedding Bouquets &amp;amp; Arrangements, Buy Artificial Bushes, Garlands, Wreaths, Plants, Topiary, Fruits, Vegetables &amp;amp; Fake Desserts Online&lt;\/a&gt;) &#8211; Has real\/natural touch Gerber Daisies, Roses and Tulips in a variety of colors. Register for them before ordering and you might get a coupon code.\n \n&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Afloral&lt;\/strong&gt; (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.afloral.com%22&gt;Silk\"]http:\/\/www.afloral.com\"&gt;Silk[\/url] Flowers, Floral Supplies and Silk Wedding Flowers&lt;\/a&gt;) &#8211; Variety of flowers available, not all are real touch.\n \n&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Crafts Etc&lt;\/strong&gt; aka Hobby Lobby (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.craftsetc.com\/%22&gt;Craft\"]http:\/\/www.craftsetc.com\/\"&gt;Craft[\/url] Supplies, Scrapbooking, Jewelry Making, Art | Crafts, Etc!&lt;\/a&gt;) - Look at their &amp;quot;True Touch&amp;quot; category. I have seen free shipping on orders over $25.\n \n&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flowers By Design&lt;\/strong&gt; (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"[url=\"http:\/\/flowers-by-design.com\/mcart2.03\/index.cgi?ID=1X4UFZ&amp;amp;task=show&amp;amp;cat=Real+Touch+Flowers%22&gt;Secure\"]http:\/\/flowers-by-design.com\/mcart2.03\/index.cgi?ID=1X4UFZ&amp;amp;task=show&amp;amp;cat=Real+Touch+Flowers\"&gt;Secure[\/url] Online Shopping - Flowers By Design&lt;\/a&gt;) &#8211; Has a variety real touch and Floramatique flowers available. They do not have a minimum order requirement. Wholesale prices are available to those with a &#8220;Resale Tax Certificate&#8221; on file with them.\n \n&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Save On Crafts&lt;\/strong&gt; (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.save-on-crafts.com\/%22&gt;Save\"]http:\/\/www.save-on-crafts.com\/\"&gt;Save[\/url] on Crafts, Wedding Supplies, Silk Flowers, Tulle, Scrapbooking &amp;amp; Discount Craft Supplies Save-on-crafts&lt;\/a&gt;) &#8211; Variety of flowers available, not all are real touch.\n \n&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;USI Floral&lt;\/strong&gt; (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"[url=\"http:\/\/www.usifloral.com\/%22&gt;Silk\"]http:\/\/www.usifloral.com\/\"&gt;Silk[\/url] Flowers, Artificial Trees Plants&lt;\/a&gt;) &#8211; Variety of flowers available, not all are real touch.\n &lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":463778,"PostDate":1222481904,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have noticed a lot of questions regarding silk flowers lately so I decided to write up a list of the some of the vendors that have been mentioned on BDW. I have personally not had contact with most of these vendors, so I have included links to helpful threads of brides who have used some of these vendors.<br \/> <br \/> [*]<strong>Hibiscus Florals<\/strong> (<a href='http:\/\/www.hibiscusflorals.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Lifelike Silk Wedding Flowers: Artificial Bridal Floral Arrangements Of Top Quality<\/a>)<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t27085' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati...om\/forum\/t27085<\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t22938' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati...om\/forum\/t22938<\/a><br \/> <br \/> [*]<strong>Plumeria&#8217;s Wedding Flower Boutique<\/strong> (<a href='http:\/\/stores.ebay.com\/Plumerias-Wedding-Flower-Boutique' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>eBay Store - Plumeria's Wedding Flower Boutique<\/a>) or (<a href='http:\/\/www.plumeriasweddingflowerboutique.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>PlumeriasWeddingFlowerBoutique<\/a>)<br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t25223' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati...om\/forum\/t25223<\/a><br \/> <a href='http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t24931' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bestdestinati...om\/forum\/t24931<\/a><br \/> [\/list] <strong><font size=\"4\">Single Stem Vendors<\/font><\/strong><ul><li><strong>1 888 Flower Mall<\/strong> - (<a href='http:\/\/www.1888flowermall.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Wholesale Artificial Silk Flowers, Wedding Bouquets & Arrangements, Buy Artificial Bushes, Garlands, Wreaths, Plants, Topiary, Fruits, Vegetables & Fake Desserts Online<\/a>) &#8211; Has real\/natural touch Gerber Daisies, Roses and Tulips in a variety of colors. Register for them before ordering and you might get a coupon code.<br \/> <br \/><\/li> <li><strong>Afloral<\/strong> (<a href='http:\/\/www.afloral.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Silk Flowers, Floral Supplies and Silk Wedding Flowers<\/a>) &#8211; Variety of flowers available, not all are real touch.<br \/> <br \/><\/li> <li><strong>Crafts Etc<\/strong> aka Hobby Lobby (<a href='http:\/\/www.craftsetc.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Craft Supplies, Scrapbooking, Jewelry Making, Art | Crafts, Etc!<\/a>) - Look at their \"True Touch\" category. I have seen free shipping on orders over $25.<br \/> <br \/><\/li> <li><strong>Flowers By Design<\/strong> (<a href='http:\/\/flowers-by-design.com\/mcart2.03\/index.cgi?ID=1X4UFZ&task=show&cat=Real+Touch+Flowers' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Secure Online Shopping - Flowers By Design<\/a>) &#8211; Has a variety real touch and Floramatique flowers available. They do not have a minimum order requirement. Wholesale prices are available to those with a &#8220;Resale Tax Certificate&#8221; on file with them.<br \/> <br \/><\/li> <li><strong>Save On Crafts<\/strong> (<a href='http:\/\/www.save-on-crafts.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Save on Crafts, Wedding Supplies, Silk Flowers, Tulle, Scrapbooking & Discount Craft Supplies Save-on-crafts<\/a>) &#8211; Variety of flowers available, not all are real touch.<br \/> <br \/><\/li> <li><strong>USI Floral<\/strong> (<a href='http:\/\/www.usifloral.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Silk Flowers, Artificial Trees Plants<\/a>) &#8211; Variety of flowers available, not all are real touch.<br \/> <\/li> <\/ul>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>19 adults\/3 children with flights booked! 10 rooms booked!<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/BM2Hm4\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/BM2Hm4\/.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dpabride.blogspot.com\/\">http:\/\/dpabride.blogspot.com\/<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kinkaid.rios@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1214427360,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210154.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Bianca","Id":210154,"Name":"Bianca","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24346,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b5dcb79c572e926c56961e110ed7de96","RawContent":"Thanks Bianca!","Attachments":[],"Id":464206,"PostDate":1222532950,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks Bianca!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb=