ent":"I don&#039;t mean to be unethical, but is there any way to purchase from Flowers by Design wholesale prices. I won&#039;t be reselling them, but just wish I could obtain the wholesale prices. Does anyone have any ideas or suggestions? \n \n Each stem comes with 8+ orchids. Does anyone have an extra flower that you can mail me so I can see the quality before I place a huge order","Attachments":[],"Id":495178,"PostDate":1225396728,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I don't mean to be unethical, but is there any way to purchase from Flowers by Design wholesale prices. I won't be reselling them, but just wish I could obtain the wholesale prices. Does anyone have any ideas or suggestions? <br \/> <br \/> Each stem comes with 8+ orchids. Does anyone have an extra flower that you can mail me so I can see the quality before I place a huge order\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hannaono@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1214961474,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210269.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":79,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hanna","Id":210269,"Name":"hanna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":24346,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKe