000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> You can dig more on their slideshow here: <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/post-678\/050810-Whitney-Vaughn-Wedding-at-Zoetry-Paraiso-de-la-Bonita-Photos-by-Matt-Adcock-and-Sol-Tamargo' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/delsolphotogr...and-Sol-Tamargo<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1175019240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53221,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2589aff5b06e5116bbebd1e886570d47","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Oh I like the vases and flowers very pretty!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1301724,"PostDate":1285898752,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Oh I like the vases and flowers very pretty!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pdoyle@centurytel.net","IpAddress":"184.158.71.108","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":12757157