{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53221,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f984463554d65718ab3cabd21587329e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I don&#039;t think it&#039;s an issue to bring petals, what&#039;s your concern?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1571473,"PostDate":1327208060,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I don't think it's an issue to bring petals, what's your concern?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"trisha.michael2012@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.3.43.19","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1324618382,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248864.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":179,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lavenderlux","Id":248864,"Name":"lavenderlux","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53221,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"262fac7316ef0a447efb6caf539be165","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My resort has a rule against bringing\/using fake petals.&amp;nbsp; You aren&#039;t allowed to use them as an aisle runner or even put them on one.&amp;nbsp; I think the real ones were ok to bring, though.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1586631,"PostDate":1330116675,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My resort has a rule against bringing\/using fake petals.\u00a0 You aren't allowed to use them as an aisle runner or even put them on one.\u00a0 I think the real ones were ok to bring, though.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tiffany.trost@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1292255804,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234580.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tia529","Id":234580,"Name":"Tia529","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53221,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"60584387e402a25d0980329fa49f6217","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; You can bring freeze dried or fake petals into mexico...but not fresh ones (im not sure they would survive the journey anyway) - any kind of plant or flower is prohibited&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1590411,"PostDate":1330977459,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> You can bring freeze dried or fake petals into mexico...but not fresh ones (im not sure they would survive the journey anyway) - any kind of plant or flower is prohibited<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jess_c_taylor@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"187.164.134.8","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1326817746,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250050.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JessiTaylor","Id":250050,"Name":"JessiTaylor","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53221,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"555e5b08e63d1f55279f726b2a4d5255","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Great info keep the ideas coming ladies:)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1591653,"PostDate":1331151585,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Great info keep the ideas coming ladies:)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/h