 are awesome\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"abs824@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1330905255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252290.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"abs824","Id":252290,"Name":"abs824","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53221,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"13dc577e7f53e6add8012dd925dbf062","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; has anyone seen 2 colours of petals used - i was thinking blue on one side of the aisle...yellow on the other. but i cant decide if it would look odd and is better to have one or the other!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1592197,"PostDate":1331237982,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> has anyone seen 2 colours of petals used - i was thinking blue on one side of the aisle...yellow on the other. but i cant decide if it would look odd and is better to have one or the other!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jess_c_taylor@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"187.164.134.8","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1326817746,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250050.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JessiTaylor","Id":250050,"Name":"JessiTaylor","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53221,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3ae30bdc8ac2cf078b1d99850cf2affe","RawContent":"Just my suggestion - but if you want to mix two colours...I would either completely mix them together.....or I would line both sides of the aisle with the one colour (blue) and put the other colour up the middle (yellow) or vice versa.....\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]JessiTaylor[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n has anyone seen 2 colours of petals used - i was thinking blue on one side of the aisle...yellow on the other. but i cant decide if it would look odd and is better to have one or the other!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1592233,"PostDate":1331242070,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Just my suggestion - but if you want to mix two colours...I would either completely mix them together.....or I would line both sides of the aisle with the one colour (blue) and put the other colour up the middle (yellow) or vice versa.....<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>JessiTaylor<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> has anyone seen 2 colours of petals used - i was thinking blue on one side of the aisle...yellow on the other. but i cant decide if it would look odd and is better to have one or the other!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Can't wait to marry my best friend on April 11, 2013!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><span style=\"font-size:10px;\"><em>49 Guests booked, and counting...<\/em><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"wrightalicia@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1326137421,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249624.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":140,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Dominican Ally","Id":249624,"Name":"Dominican Ally","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53221,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"93b64c4c6a9511024840271ea84db24a","RawContent":"2 colors mixed together looks really pretty","Attachments":[],"Id":1592263,"PostDate":1331245651,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                2 colors mixed together looks really pretty\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>46 booked and counting!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bellaangels@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1309488391,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241828.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"stella331","Id":241828,"Name":"stella331","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":53221,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0765b386f5b5864f34bbac371f779e73","RawContent":"yeah i think that sounds better thanks!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Dominican Ally[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n Just my suggestion - but if you want to mix two colours...I would either completely mix them together.....or I would line both sides of the aisle with the one colour (blue) and put the other colour up the middle (yellow) or vice versa.....\n   \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1593383,"PostDate":1331518897,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> yeah i think that sounds better thanks!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Dominican Ally<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> Just my suggestion - but if you want to mix two colours...I would either completely mix them together.....or I would line both sides of the aisle with the one colour (blue) and put the other colour up the middle (yellow) or vice versa.....<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jess_c_taylor@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"187.164.134.8","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1326817746,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250050.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JessiTaylor","Id":250050,"Name":"JessiTaylor","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":50,"TotalPages":5,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":40},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
