leased with them. I am on the fence still about ordering them and having to bring them down but flowers down at Azul Sensatori are so crazy expensive, would love to know everyone&#039;s thoughts!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886821,"PostDate":1424368222,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am curious where everyone (if you got real touch flowers) where you got them and were you pleased with them. I am on the fence still about ordering them and having to bring them down but flowers down at Azul Sensatori are so crazy expensive, would love to know everyone's thoughts!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"atyson03@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.253.164.150","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1397071192,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277535.jpg?_r=1397079819","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"atyson03","Id":277535,"Name":"atyson03","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.249.106.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78815,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by kellymiller, 19 February 2015 - 02:51 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1424386302,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e5f7d8a105af0981498f0d48d6b86435","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I got mine from Lily of Angeles on etsy. I received them last week and they look great! I haven&#039;t used them yet, but I&#039;m sure they will look great in our photos&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886868,"PostDate":1424386282,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I got mine from Lily of Angeles on etsy. I received them last week and they look great! I haven't used them yet, but I'm sure they will look great in our photos<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelly_miller_@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.249.122.85","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390772931,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kellymiller","Id":276338,"Name":"kellymiller","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78815,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53c71aac76ff8cd82c6757690da9573d","RawContent":"Bloom Bridal uses them for their bouquets I do believe. Check out their website - unreal work!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1886931,"PostDate":1424404768,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"