{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":13,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1010,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1895913,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282406,"Name":"Lisa35","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282406.jpg?_r=1426179017","PhotoWidth":177,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1431357763,"LastPoster":{"Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282964.jpg?_r=1431149209","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":43,"Preview":{"Id":1895913,"PostDate":1431357763,"PostContent":"Hello ladies, has anyone ever brought or thinking of bringing a \"fake cake\" to take pictures with...","Author":{"Signature":"<p>The Future Mrs. Rodrigues","Email":"lisapereira11@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426172786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282406.jpg?_r=1426179017","PhotoWidth":177,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lisa35","Id":282406,"Name":"Lisa35","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"acab24626e48133db5b0780617d026a5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello ladies, has anyone ever brought or thinking of bringing a \"fake cake\" to take pictures with? I really don&#039;t like the look of the cake that our resort offers so I thought of bringing a fake cake with us? Suggestions? Thoughts?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895913,"PostDate":1431357763,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello ladies, has anyone ever brought or thinking of bringing a \"fake cake\" to take pictures with? I really don't like the look of the cake that our resort offers so I thought of bringing a fake cake with us? Suggestions? Thoughts?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>The Future Mrs. Rodrigues","Email":"lisapereira11@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426172786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282406.jpg?_r=1426179017","PhotoWidth":177,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lisa35","Id":282406,"Name":"Lisa35","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.174.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf7f8955658238c59b5e10904c6619f8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m probably not a good person to answer, but carrying a fake cake down sounds inconvenient to me just for a photo opp. With such a gorgeous setting there will be plenty of other awesome pictures and memories!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;But, honestly, the cake is easily the lowest on my priority list. I&#039;m not even doing a cake topper or decorating the cake table - and I&#039;m not planning to stop the party to formally do a cake cutting. As long as it is delicious (I do love to EAT cake) I don&#039;t care! :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895921,"PostDate":1431365075,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm probably not a good person to answer, but carrying a fake cake down sounds inconvenient to me just for a photo opp. With such a gorgeous setting there will be plenty of other awesome pictures and memories!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>But, honestly, the cake is easily the lowest on my priority list. I'm not even doing a cake topper or decorating the cake table - and I'm not planning to stop the party to formally do a cake cutting. As long as it is delicious (I do love to EAT cake) I don't care! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403116087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f90707766b80a8a97fe026b6a1fb5d14","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I don&#039;t like the cake options that they have given us, that&#039;s why I was thinking of bringing a fake cake. I too don&#039;t plan on stopping the party for cake cutting however, I do want the traditional pictures with the cake.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895932,"PostDate":1431371107,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I don't like the cake options that they have given us, that's why I was thinking of bringing a fake cake. I too don't plan on stopping the party for cake cutting however, I do want the traditional pictures with the cake.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>The Future Mrs. Rodrigues","Email":"lisapereira11@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426172786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282406.jpg?_r=1426179017","PhotoWidth":177,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lisa35","Id":282406,"Name":"Lisa35","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.152.61.210","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"30afc6510bef76350d7e76612b36cb96","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think it&#039;s a great idea , my wedding was in February and the cake I picked looked nothing like the photos the resort had shown me. &amp;nbsp;Everyone will be too busy having fun to even notice the fake cake I&#039;m sure :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895947,"PostDate":1431379657,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think it's a great idea , my wedding was in February and the cake I picked looked nothing like the photos the resort had shown me. \u00a0Everyone will be too busy having fun to even notice the fake cake I'm sure <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ariaslidia22@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"69.152.61.210","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1400796250,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278082.jpg?_r=1400862137","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lidy22","Id":278082,"Name":"lidy22","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"930d4cd270b0d4e0248d50833f879c63","RawContent":"I think it would be difficult because I thought with the fake cake you still have to decorate it with fondant and stuff","Attachments":[],"Id":1895952,"PostDate":1431391021,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I think it would be difficult because I thought with the fake cake you still have to decorate it with fondant and stuff\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406736672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.51.43.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c8ed29b344f9aa88cc84e6d48ed02d9a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think it fake cake could work, but it seems like you would still have to decorate it right? Or if it&#039;s pre-decorated, bringing it to your destination without worrying about it getting damaged, might be a hassle. If the cake options at your resort aren&#039;t up to your taste - can you ask them to do something simpler and maybe give them some inspiration photos? Perhaps just decorating it simply with just flowers?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Or, how about cake alternatives?!? Check out this article I posted here on the forum a few weeks ago -- cake doesn&#039;t have to be the only option :P:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/5-wedding-cake-alternatives-you-your-gues-r2248&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/5-wedding-cake-alternatives-you-your-gues-r2248&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope that helps!! Let us know what you decide ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895981,"PostDate":1431424185,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think it fake cake could work, but it seems like you would still have to decorate it right? Or if it's pre-decorated, bringing it to your destination without worrying about it getting damaged, might be a hassle. If the cake options at your resort aren't up to your taste - can you ask them to do something simpler and maybe give them some inspiration photos? Perhaps just decorating it simply with just flowers?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Or, how about cake alternatives?!? Check out this article I posted here on the forum a few weeks ago -- cake doesn't have to be the only option <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/>:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/5-wedding-cake-alternatives-you-your-gues-r2248' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...your-gues-r2248<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope that helps!! Let us know what you decide <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia;\"><strong>MARIESAM SANCHEZ PHOTOGRAPHY<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\nWEBSITE: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><br>\nBLOG: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchezblog.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\/blog'>\/blog<\/a><br>\nCONTACT ME: <a  class=\"bbc_email\" href=\"mailto:mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com?subject=BDW%20Inquiry\" title=\"E-mail Link\">mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com<\/a><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/i287.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll150\/msam007562\/063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\" alt=\"063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\">","Email":"mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.100.61.37","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1285954345,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232833.jpg?_r=1422091823","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","Id":232833,"Name":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"46f674b46af3575dcf54b5d81a00371d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I agree with some of the ladies here. I think that us brides tend to overthink things (my coworker was just telling me this haha) especially when we have so long to wait for our date..it gives even more time to think and doubt, and doubt some more. Is your resort willing to decorate it a different way? My resort was offering a very boring white cake with a few carnation stems on top. I bought a gold cake topper and I&#039;ve requested for them to do coral rossettes.. (i&#039;m paying a bit extra, but it was worth it for me as I am stopping to cut cake and i&#039;m decorating my cake table).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you have your heart set on an artificial cake then you should do it, but it just sounds like a bit of extra work with lugging it down there. Most of the time everything else will outshine the cake in pictures anyway.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895986,"PostDate":1431434424,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I agree with some of the ladies here. I think that us brides tend to overthink things (my coworker was just telling me this haha) especially when we have so long to wait for our date..it gives even more time to think and doubt, and doubt some more. Is your resort willing to decorate it a different way? My resort was offering a very boring white cake with a few carnation stems on top. I bought a gold cake topper and I've requested for them to do coral rossettes.. (i'm paying a bit extra, but it was worth it for me as I am stopping to cut cake and i'm decorating my cake table).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you have your heart set on an artificial cake then you should do it, but it just sounds like a bit of extra work with lugging it down there. Most of the time everything else will outshine the cake in pictures anyway.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba93cee1d4979fc8eed9baa48643b3c7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;sub&gt;I think I am overthinking this whole cake thing....I guess us brides tend to do that. Although, I still think its a great idea, it may in fact be a hassle getting through the airport. Every bride that has gotten married at our resort, says the same thing about the cake. Its awful looking and even though you send them photos, it always turns out nothing like it. I have a specific vision I want for the cake and I will truly be disappointed if I end up with a very ugly one. After all, it will be in my wedding pictures for the rest of my life. &lt;\/sub&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895994,"PostDate":1431437546,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><sub>I think I am overthinking this whole cake thing....I guess us brides tend to do that. Although, I still think its a great idea, it may in fact be a hassle getting through the airport. Every bride that has gotten married at our resort, says the same thing about the cake. Its awful looking and even though you send them photos, it always turns out nothing like it. I have a specific vision I want for the cake and I will truly be disappointed if I end up with a very ugly one. After all, it will be in my wedding pictures for the rest of my life. <\/sub><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>The Future Mrs. Rodrigues","Email":"lisapereira11@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"74.15.166.172","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1426172786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282406.jpg?_r=1426179017","PhotoWidth":177,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lisa35","Id":282406,"Name":"Lisa35","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"930d10bfabfabb89253777091be03f82","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Lisa35\"] Are you able to pay to upgrade the design or anything? Like I mentioned before, the basic cake at my resort is very plain and not much to look at.. I paid a bit to upgrade the icing\/colour etc. Out of curiousity, do you have a picture of the cake that they offer? I&#039;m dying to see it now.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1895997,"PostDate":1431440171,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282406\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282406-lisa35\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Lisa35<\/span><\/a> Are you able to pay to upgrade the design or anything? Like I mentioned before, the basic cake at my resort is very plain and not much to look at.. I paid a bit to upgrade the icing\/colour etc. Out of curiousity, do you have a picture of the cake that they offer? I'm dying to see it now.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79174,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fcc11df946829bf789092c4d4915c5c5","RawContent":"My resort made our cake nothing like the pictures. It was hideous. When it came out I was upset but now I laugh about it...it was crazy how wrong it was . I have so many other pics that it doesn&#039;t matter at all. It tasted delicious though! \n\n\nWhy don&#039;t you just get a plain white cake and bring a cake topper ? How bad could they get that?","Attachments":[],"Id":1896047,"PostDate":1431459141,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                My resort made our cake nothing like the pictures. It was hideous. When it came out I was upset but now I laugh about it...it was crazy how wrong it was . I have so many other pics that it doesn't matter at all. It tasted delicious though! <br><br>\nWhy don't you just get a plain white cake and bring a cake topper ? How bad could they get that? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406736672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79174","Title":"Fake Cake","LastPostDate":1432438611},"Pages":{"TotalItems":13,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
