{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.89.111","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79058,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3cda78012402a9ac991d118afe16834b","RawContent":"i like that idea. My resort allowed Chinese lanterns so we did that at the end which was awesome. I kind of liked breaking the dancing up. A few things ..I wouldn&#039;t count on Walmart to have them because PV Walmart did not and its not a normal thing Walmart carries I believe. My next point would be do not bring them on plane! I was thinking about sneaking them on but they are considered an explosive so you risk a felony charge... It&#039;s not like they would just throw them away it would be a big deal and I would not want to risk being detained before my wedding! I&#039;d ask my WC to arrange","Attachments":[],"Id":1893041,"PostDate":1429022878,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i like that idea. My resort allowed Chinese lanterns so we did that at the end which was awesome. I kind of liked breaking the dancing up. A few things ..I wouldn't count on Walmart to have them because PV Walmart did not and its not a normal thing Walmart carries I believe. My next point would be do not bring them on plane! I was thinking about sneaking them on but they are considered an explosive so you risk a felony charge... It's not like they would just throw them away it would be a big deal and I would not want to risk being detained before my wedding! I'd ask my WC to arrange \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406736672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79058,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e7c369d871479ca4b5121435e4302a4e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"nadiakat17\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks for advice!&amp;nbsp; Ya, no sparklers on the plane.&amp;nbsp; If I were allowed sparklers on the plane I wouldn&#039;t even think twice.&amp;nbsp; Dollar store carries them.  &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"perianjay\"] I am going to make a tag for each sparkler.&amp;nbsp; It will say,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;Let Amor Sparkle&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;light our first dance&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;June 20, 2015&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;A&amp;amp;B&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"text-align:center;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was thinking of having them at a table with a sign that says \"Please join us for a sparkling first dance\" or something like that.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ll probably tell our bridal party ahead of time so that they can make sure people are on the ball for this.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893046,"PostDate":1429023467,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"279229\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/279229-nadiakat17\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">nadiakat17<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for advice!\u00a0 Ya, no sparklers on the plane.\u00a0 If I were allowed sparklers on the plane I wouldn't even think twice.\u00a0 Dollar store carries them.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> I am going to make a tag for each sparkler.\u00a0 It will say,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\">Let Amor Sparkle<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\">light our first dance<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\">June 20, 2015<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\">A&B<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p  style=\"text-align:center\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was thinking of having them at a table with a sign that says \"Please join us for a sparkling first dance\" or something like that.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We'll probably tell our bridal party ahead of time so that they can make sure people are on the ball for this.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Married on June 20th, 2015 at the Grand Sunset Princess Riviera Gazebo & Reception at the Chill Out with 60 guests<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>My review thread: \u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396982852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1439827749","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":132,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79058,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b81e305fd7357040a64705e340603551","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"veryvalentine\"] Cute! I haven&#039;t even thought of tags yet. If you do make them.. would you mind sharing your template with me?? :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also, don&#039;t know if you saw my other post, but how do you think you will have them all lit at the same time? I was thinking about how to do this. I don&#039;t want to bring 30 lighters lol.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Great idea with having them on the table. I think we plan to have our first dance in the very beginning of the reception (before eating) so I may just have the resort put a sparker beside each plate with the note about lighting the first dance.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893047,"PostDate":1429023677,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277519\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277519-veryvalentine\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">veryvalentine<\/span><\/a> Cute! I haven't even thought of tags yet. If you do make them.. would you mind sharing your template with me?? <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also, don't know if you saw my other post, but how do you think you will have them all lit at the same time? I was thinking about how to do this. I don't want to bring 30 lighters lol.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Great idea with having them on the table. I think we plan to have our first dance in the very beginning of the reception (before eating) so I may just have the resort put a sparker beside each plate with the note about lighting the first dance.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"154.20.36.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79058,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b8e4a1352ea1d3a4dd42b5244d339100","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh yea! That makes sense lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893053,"PostDate":1429024027,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh yea! That makes sense lol<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"millar_devon@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"154.20.36.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423329313,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282027.jpg?_r=1429713632","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Victoriabride","Id":282027,"Name":"Victoriabride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79058,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1429024504,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ffbddef75c9b4c453241e4904a50e0d9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"perianjay\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Will it be dark yet&amp;nbsp;at the beginning&amp;nbsp;of the reception?&amp;nbsp; Oh you are a December bride so it probably will be ;)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;hmmm...I thought about it and I think what we will do is have the bridal party = 10 people equipped with lighters and then they start lighting everyone as they form a circle.&amp;nbsp; people will probably need 2 or 3.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;It seems picture perfect in my head...but I could see how the circle might not be so perfect if people have to re-light.&amp;nbsp; lol&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We have about 40-50 guests so I think that with 10 people lighting them it should be fine.&amp;nbsp; Once people have their sparkler lit they can light someone else&#039;s too.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ll def. share the template once it&amp;nbsp;finish putting it all together.&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893058,"PostDate":1429024474,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Will it be dark yet\u00a0at the beginning\u00a0of the reception?\u00a0 Oh you are a December bride so it probably will be <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>hmmm...I thought about it and I think what we will do is have the bridal party = 10 people equipped with lighters and then they start lighting everyone as they form a circle.\u00a0 people will probably need 2 or 3.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It seems picture perfect in my head...but I could see how the circle might not be so perfect if people have to re-light.\u00a0 lol\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have about 40-50 guests so I think that with 10 people lighting them it should be fine.\u00a0 Once people have their sparkler lit they can light someone else's too.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'll def. share the template once it\u00a0finish putting it all together.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Married on June 20th, 2015 at the Grand Sunset Princess Riviera Gazebo & Reception at the Chill Out with 60 guests<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>My review thread: \u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396982852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1439827749","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":132,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79058,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d59c46039ea02d897a77c14984121a70","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Love this idea! &amp;nbsp;@[member=\"veryvalentine\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m def going to look into this when we book our resort.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Excited to see your pics!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893060,"PostDate":1429025078,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Love this idea! \u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277519\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277519-veryvalentine\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">veryvalentine<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm def going to look into this when we book our resort.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Excited to see your pics!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><img src=\"http:\/\/\" alt=\"\"><\/div>\n<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;0\/st\/20160423\/e\/we+leave+for+Mexico%21\/k\/c059\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;32;116\/st\/20160430\/e\/we+say+I+do%21\/k\/8afc\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread:<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79580-deecols-planning-thread-gbp-april-30th-2016\/#entry1904529<\/a>","Email":"deannaproteau@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"207.134.141.162","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1421442569,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281751.jpg?_r=1443808962","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"deecol","Id":281751,"Name":"deecol","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79058,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"96a5e09e0112ecfeb2c7e438c2336c32","RawContent":"@[member=\"veryvalentine\"] I&#039;ve been wanting to do this as well but not sure how feasible it is to get sparklers so thanks for starting the thread!\n\n\n@[member=\"perianjay\"] thanks for the tip on asking your photographer, I&#039;ll see if he can get some for me.\n\n\nDo you guys think you can light them by having lit candles (bigger ones) say maybe a few or one on each table then use those to light the sparklers? The candles would have to be in a bigger hurricane vase so they stay lit. If outside and windy, it may be hard to get a lighter lit!","Attachments":[],"Id":1893071,"PostDate":1429028004,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277519\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277519-veryvalentine\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">veryvalentine<\/span><\/a> I've been wanting to do this as well but not sure how feasible it is to get sparklers so thanks for starting the thread!<br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> thanks for the tip on asking your photographer, I'll see if he can get some for me.<br><br>\nDo you guys think you can light them by having lit candles (bigger ones) say maybe a few or one on each table then use those to light the sparklers? The candles would have to be in a bigger hurricane vase so they stay lit. If outside and windy, it may be hard to get a lighter lit!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410098585,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1444491864","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79058,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e27f1c0b418cb5da6095bd15ad0b36ba","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve read, because of course I googled, \"how to light sparklers for a send off\"&amp;nbsp; and they said that it was easier to light sparklers using another sparkler.&amp;nbsp; Matches would require you to be too close to the sparks, a lighter works as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I contacted our d\u00e9cor girl from Love and Lace and she sells the sparklers for $3cnd each.&amp;nbsp; ouch. They are 45cm long though, so we may only need 1 per person as it might last long enough.&amp;nbsp; That&#039;s like 100 in sparklers :(  &amp;nbsp; ugh.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893073,"PostDate":1429028859,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I've read, because of course I googled, \"how to light sparklers for a send off\"\u00a0 and they said that it was easier to light sparklers using another sparkler.\u00a0 Matches would require you to be too close to the sparks, a lighter works as well.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I contacted our d\u00e9cor girl from Love and Lace and she sells the sparklers for $3cnd each.\u00a0 ouch. They are 45cm long though, so we may only need 1 per person as it might last long enough.\u00a0 That's like 100 in sparklers <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 ugh.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Married on June 20th, 2015 at the Grand Sunset Princess Riviera Gazebo & Reception at the Chill Out with 60 guests<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>My review thread: \u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396982852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1439827749","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":132,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79058,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a32418d47e105f1cfda0bf20bdc20c82","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"veryvalentine\"] Eeek. That&#039;s so expensive. I&#039;m paying $1 a piece and they are 50cm sparklers.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893083,"PostDate":1429032303,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277519\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277519-veryvalentine\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">veryvalentine<\/span><\/a> Eeek. That's so expensive. I'm paying $1 a piece and they are 50cm sparklers.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1453235488","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79058,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"207070a98a87a807a1542e578cad13b9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"perianjay\"] Those are epic sparklers.&amp;nbsp; I wonder if your photographer could tell us where to get them?&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;my dad is in mexico and I&#039;m going to send him on a hunt in the next few days&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1893092,"PostDate":1429033977,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> Those are epic sparklers.\u00a0 I wonder if your photographer could tell us where to get them?\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>my dad is in mexico and I'm going to send him on a hunt in the next few days<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Married on June 20th, 2015 at the Grand Sunset Princess Riviera Gazebo & Reception at the Chill Out with 60 guests<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>My review thread: \u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress"